    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>Smoke obscures creatures' vision, causes them to choke, and burns their eyes.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Smoke_Statistics_.28CL_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Smoke_Statistics_(CL_2)\">Smoke Statistics (CL 2)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Atmosphere, Natural </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature begins its turn in Smoke. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +4 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains in the Smoke. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Smoke grants <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> to creatures and objects within it. </p>",
